Package: ggpointless
Title: Extra Geometries and Stats for 'ggplot2'
Version: 0.2.0.990
Authors@R: 
    person(
     given = "Markus",
     family = "Döring",
     email = "m4rkus.doering@gmail.com",
     role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Provides additional geometries and statistical layers for
    'ggplot2'. Includes visual-effect geoms built on 'grid' linear and
    radial gradients and Porter-Duff compositing — faded areas, paths,
    bars, rectangles, and ridgelines, plus points with a glow — alongside
    mathematically driven layers such as catenary curves, Chaikin's
    corner-cutting smoothing, and truncated Fourier-series reconstruction.
    Also ships Lexis diagrams, selective highlighting of extreme and
    first / last observations, unit (isotype) bar charts, and grid lines
    that draw above other layers.
